{
  "description": "Mirall upward plane v1 test vectors. Test keys only. Generated by scripts/emit-upward-vectors.ts. A request is POST <apiUrl><path> with the four headers; the instance key signs `message`, which hashes the body bytes exactly as sent. instance-enroll's body also carries the enrollment key's signature over `enrollmentMessage`. Body timestamps are epoch milliseconds; the header timestamp is unix seconds. An optional report's reportCounter is strictly greater on every request an install sends with a report, retries included, and is stored before sending; an equal or lower value marks a copied machine. The JSON Schema for every body is packages/contracts/fleet/upward-v1.schema.json.",
